使用下图解决方案所创建应用。

(https://o2-img.alistatic.com/i/i09blZ/w0nHEUCvAMy0fYvIrbLSF-e71c849bf8.png)


## hsf 触发器

脚手架默认生成的代码为 HSF 触发器，对应的类见下图

(https://o2-img.alistatic.com/i/i09blZ/ZzAWc5EGBvGrolv6J8mCJ-e330bd8f24.png)


对应的触发器配置为

(https://o2-img.alistatic.com/i/i09blZ/ruL0itKDGCzUw45NQ3aoI-016a94a846.png)


```
{
  "spec-version": "1.1.0",
  "functions": [
    {
      "name": "app",
      "archive": "./archives/app.zip",
      "handler": "com.alibaba.aonefaas.PojoHandler",
      "trigger": [
        {
          "hsf": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "platform": ["fiber"]
}

```
## http 触发器

如果你想发布函数为 http 服务，则需如下改动

修改触发器配置文件为下述配置

```
{
  "spec-version": "1.1.0",
  "functions": [
    {
      "name": "app",
      "archive": "./archives/app.zip",
      "handler": "com.alibaba.aonefaas.HttpHandler",
      "trigger": [
        {
          "http": {
            "method": ["get", "post", "put", "delete", "head"],
            "path": "/*"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "gateway": {
    "kind": "simple-mapping",
    "paths": {
      "/*": {
        "GET": {
          "x-gateway-intergration": {
            "type": "function",
            "url": {
              "group": "${自己应用的应用名}", // 特别注意！！
              "name": "app",
              "version": "latest"
            }
          }
        },
        "POST": {
          "x-gateway-intergration": {
            "type": "function",
            "url": {
              "group": "${自己应用的应用名}", // 特别注意！！
              "name": "app",
              "version": "latest"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "x-gateway-domain": "${自己应用的应用名}.fn.alibaba-inc.com" // 特别注意！！
  },
  "platform": ["fiber"]
}

```


